  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tMTD IT\n\t\tMTD IT\n\n### MTD IT: How to unauthorise/revoke HMRC Authorisation for a Client\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 6 Jul, 2026 at  1:44 PM\n\n### This article explains how to revoke HMRC authorisation for a client in Capium MTD IT. You may need to do this if:\n\nYou have authorised a client using incorrect credentials\nYou are unable to fetch information from HMRC for that client\nHMRC has asked you to reauthorise the client\n\nImportant: Revoking authorisation will stop the HMRC data sync immediately. If submissions have already been made for this client, no further submissions can be made until the client is reauthorise\n\n### \n\n### If you've created a tax return this will need to be deleted first:\nThen follow the below steps\nHow to Revoke AuthorisationGo to Navigation > MTD IT > Manage.\n\nUse the search to locate the relevant client.\nClick on the client's name to open their record.\nNext to the client's name, click the Authorised button.\nA pop-up will appear asking you to confirm the revocation of HMRC authorisation.\nRead the confirmation message, then click I confirm that I want to revoke the HMRC authorisation.\nThe authorisation for that client will now be revoked.\n\n### What Happens After Revocation\n\nOnce authorisation has been revoked:\n\nThe HMRC data sync for the client will stop immediately.\nAny previously made submissions will remain, but no further submissions can be made.\nTo submit data or retrieve information again, you will need to reauthorise the client.\nIf you are moving the client to another software, you can proceed after revoking without needing to take any further action in Capium MTD IT.\n\nIf you intend to continue using Capium MTD IT for this client, refer to the authorisation article to reauthorise them on the system.\n\n### Capium Tip\n\nIf you have reauthorised a client multiple times and are still not seeing their income sources, it is worth checking the Agent Services Account to confirm whether the client has been linked to the MTD IT system. If the issue persists after checking this, contact HMRC directly to investigate further.\n\n### \n\n### Related Articles\n\nMTD IT: Client Authorisation Workflow\nMTD IT: Checking and Registering Your Client with HMRC\nMTD IT: Bulk Authorisation\nMTD IT: How to Allow Software to Connect with HMRC\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118618\">MTD IT</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000201911\">MTD IT</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">MTD IT: How to unauthorise/revoke HMRC Authorisation for a Client\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 6 Jul, 2026 at  1:44 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This article explains how to revoke HMRC authorisation for a client in Capium MTD IT. You may need to do this if:</span></span></h3><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">You have authorised a client using incorrect credentials</span></span></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">You are unable to fetch information from HMRC for that client</span></span></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">HMRC has asked you to reauthorise the client</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><table style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100%; background-color: rgb(184, 49, 47); font-size: 14px;\"><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Important:</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;Revoking authorisation will stop the HMRC data sync immediately. If submissions have already been made for this client, no further submissions can be made until the client is reauthorise</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></h3><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">If you've created a tax return this will need to be deleted first:</span></span><br><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9251000010/original/BaS2FJU2hLpCsLAKFUlehF4CoNBlB1luOw.png?1783341864\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9251000010\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=