pear asking you to confirm the revocation of HMRC authorisation.</span></span></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Read the confirmation message, then click <strong>I confirm that I want to revoke the HMRC authorisation</strong>.</span></span></li></ol><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The authorisation for that client will now be revoked.</span></span></p><hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong><u>What Happens After Revocation</u></strong></span></span></h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Once authorisation has been revoked:</span></span></p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The HMRC data sync for the client will stop immediately.</span></span></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Any previously made submissions will remain, but no further submissions can be made.</span></span></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">To submit data or retrieve information again, you will need to reauthorise the client.</span></span></li></ul><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">If you are moving the client to another software, you can proceed after revoking without needing to take any further action in Capium MTD IT.</span></span><br><br></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">If you intend to continue using Capium MTD IT for this client, refer to the authorisation article to reauthorise them on the system.</span></span></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100%; background-color: rgb(85, 57, 130);\"><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong><u>Capium Tip</u></strong></span></span></h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: