espace-normal break-words pl-2\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/9000276525-mtd-it-bulk-authorisation\">MTD IT: Bulk Authorisation</a></span></span></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/9000274758-mtd-it-how-to-allow-software-to-connect-with-hmrc\">MTD IT: How to Allow Software to Connect with HMRC</a></span></li></ul>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000277172\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000277172/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000277172\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000277172/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000277172\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p